  <li><strong>Meetup date:</strong> Monday, 9. November 2026 and Tuesday, 10. November 2026</li>
  <li>All deadlines expire 23:59 AoE</li>
  <li><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfn61wC8f0o3jcuZACXbPixAuaO-XzPUQu7Ru6suxBqTXYQZw/viewform?usp=publish-editor">Submission Form</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdLfKpBe7LykZnPSYOkr0JLQHjQY-P3lZChUZcRI0d2kJ9WdQ/viewform?usp=header">Attendance Registration</a></li>
